# Working files that live alongside the site but are never published.
#
# Only source-only formats are ignored by pattern. Image, video and JPG/PNG
# exports are listed one by one instead, because the site serves those same
# types and a broad pattern would silently keep a new export out of a commit.

# Local tooling
.claude/

# Design sources
